.TH TWELF-PM 1
.SH NAME
twelf-pm \- offline package manager and toolchain for Twelf
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B twelf-pm
[\fIcommand\fR] [\fIflags\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Declarative Twelf project tool: lockfile, namespace isolation, build, doc, LSP.
Depends only on SML/NJ and Twelf. Fully offline.
.SH COMMANDS
check, build, tree, verify, doctor, outdated, info, search, yank, graph, completion, test,
init, new, add, vendor, publish, ns, fmt, debug, doc, latex, lsp, hook, badge
.SH FLAGS
--json --locked --force --strict --no-rewrite --timings --verbose --quiet --no-color
.SH EXIT CODES
0 ok, 1 build, 2 config, 3 namespace, 4 lockfile, 5 registry
